#
# Message queue
#
CronjobWhatsappProcessQueue = Process the WhatsApp message queue
CronjobWhatsappProcessQueueComment = Sends the WhatsApp queue messages in a throttled way to avoid being flagged as SPAM. The cadence (messages per run, window and jitter) and the retries are configured in the module setup, "Message queue" section. Leave this task parameters empty to use that configuration. Optionally you can force the cadence with positional parameters: maxToSend, windowSeconds, jitterSeconds (e.g. "1, 150, 30").
