WHATSAPP_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODE = Default country code
WHATSAPP_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODETooltip = Country code (without "+") prepended to numbers that have no international prefix, when normalizing the phone before sending. Default 34 (Spain).
WHATSAPP_REMINDER_MAX_RETRIES = Reminder retries
WHATSAPP_REMINDER_MAX_RETRIESTooltip = Number of retries for failed scheduled WhatsApp reminders before giving up. Default 3.
WHATSAPP_COMBINE_TEXT_WITH_DOC = Combine text and document in one message
WHATSAPP_COMBINE_TEXT_WITH_DOCTooltip = When sending a document (PDF/image/video) together with text, send the text (subject + body) as the document caption in a single message instead of two separate messages. Applies to both direct send and queue. If the text is longer than 1024 characters it is sent separately.
WhatsappQueueSettings = WhatsApp message queue
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_MAX_RETRIES = Max retries
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_MAX_RETRIESTooltip = Number of retries on transient errors (network, timeout, 5xx, 429) before the message is marked as Failed and dropped from the queue. Permanent errors (invalid number, 4xx, missing file) are not retried. Default 3.
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_BACKOFF_SECONDS = Backoff between retries (seconds)
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_BACKOFF_SECONDSTooltip = Base seconds to wait between retries, multiplied by the retry number (retry 1 = 1x, retry 2 = 2x...). Default 300.
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_MAX_PER_RUN = Messages per run (N)
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_MAX_PER_RUNTooltip = Maximum number of messages sent on each cron run. Overridden by the 1st scheduled task parameter when provided. Default 1.
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_WINDOW_SECONDS = Window between batches (seconds)
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_WINDOW_SECONDSTooltip = Minimum seconds between send batches. Overridden by the 2nd scheduled task parameter when provided. Default 150.
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_JITTER_SECONDS = Jitter (seconds)
WHATSAPP_QUEUE_JITTER_SECONDSTooltip = Random seconds added to the window for a more natural sending pattern. Overridden by the 3rd scheduled task parameter when provided. Default 30.
WHATSAPP_FORCE_QUEUE = Enqueue reminders
WHATSAPP_FORCE_QUEUETooltip = If enabled, WhatsApp reminders are enqueued instead of being sent immediately, subject to the queue cadence.
